<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Teacher's Month, Ma'am Mari!</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="art">

            <div class="badge">🌸 TEACHER'S MONTH 🌸</div>

            <h1>Tribute to Our Amazing Teacher</h1>

            <h2>Ma'am Mari 💐</h2>

            <p class="intro">
                Thank you, Ma'am Mari, for being an amazing teacher who
                inspires us to learn, grow, and become better students.
            </p>

            <div class="divider">✦ ✦ ✦</div>

            <div class="message-box">
                <h3>💖 A Special Message for You</h3>

                <p>
                    Thank you for your patience, kindness, and dedication.
                    You always take the time to guide us and help us
                    understand every lesson.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We are grateful for every lesson, every reminder,
                    every activity, and every moment you spend teaching us.
                    Your effort and hard work will always be appreciated.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Especially in coding and HTML, thank you for patiently
                    teaching us even when our codes don't work the way
                    we expect them to. Your guidance helps us improve
                    and learn from our mistakes.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="qualities">

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon">📚</div>
                    <h3>Patient</h3>
                    <p>Thank you for patiently teaching and guiding us.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon">💡</div>
                    <h3>Inspiring</h3>
                    <p>You inspire us to keep learning and improving.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon">❤️</div>
                    <h3>Caring</h3>
                    <p>Your kindness makes learning more meaningful.</p>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="quote">
                <p>
                    "A great teacher doesn't just teach lessons,
                    but also leaves a lasting impact on the lives
                    of their students."
                </p>
            </div>

            <button onclick="showMessage()">💐 Click for a Surprise 💐</button>

            <p id="surprise"></p>

            <div class="divider">✦ ✦ ✦</div>

            <p class="thankyou">
                Thank you, Ma'am Mari! ❤️
            </p>

            <p class="closing">
                With love and gratitude from your students.
            </p>

            <p class="footer">
                Happy Teacher's Month 2026! 🌷
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

    <script>
        function showMessage() {
            document.getElementById("surprise").innerHTML =
                "🌷 You are one of the teachers we will always remember. Thank you for everything, Ma'am Mari! ❤️";
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
